l Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0558":{"code":"F-0558","title":"Reasonably accommodate the needs and preferences of each resident.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0576":{"code":"F-0576","title":"Ensure residents have reasonable access to and privacy in their use of communication methods.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0583":{"code":"F-0583","title":"Keep residents' personal and medical records private and confidential.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0585":{"code":"F-0585","title":"Honor the resident's right to voice grievances without discrimination or reprisal and the facility must establish a grievance policy and make prompt efforts to resolve grievances.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0600":{"code":"F-0600","title":"Protect each resident from all types of abuse such as physical, mental, sexual abuse, physical punishment, and neglect by anybody.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0609":{"code":"F-0609","title":"Timely report suspected abuse, neglect, or theft and report the results of the investigation to proper authorities.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0656":{"code":"F-0656","title":"Develop and implement a complete care plan that meets all the resident's needs, with timetables and actions that can be measured.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Defic